Thus $AP=\sqrt{20}=2\sqrt{5}$.
Similarly, $BP=\sqrt{(4-10)^2+(2-0)^2}=\sqrt{36+4}=2\sqrt{10}$.
Also, $CP=\sqrt{(4-3)^2+(2-5)^2}=\sqrt{1+9}=\sqrt{10}$, so $AP+BP+CP=2\sqrt{5}+3\sqrt{10}$.
Therefore $m=2$ and $n=3$, giving $m+n=5$.

